{"id":"morocco-sahara-4x4","title":"Morocco's Sahara by 4x4: Merzouga to Foum Zguid","who":"Classic route · desert pistes of southern Morocco","when":"October to April","vehicle":"4x4 (ideally two), 5–7 days","kind":"4x4","color":"#dc2626","summary":"From the tall dunes of Erg Chebbi west along the Algerian border on desert pistes, through Zagora and the Draa palm groves to M'Hamid, then the classic sand crossing past the dunes of Erg Chigaga and over the dry bed of Lac Iriki to Foum Zguid. Soft sand and fech-fech: go with a guide or a second vehicle.","sources":[{"label":"Horizons Unlimited: piste M'Hamid to Foum Zguid","url":"https://horizonsunlimited.com/hubb/morocco/piste-mhamid-to-form-ziguid-84644"},{"label":"Charlie's Travels: off-road M'hamid to Foum Zguid","url":"https://charlies-travels.com/en/unique-experience/mhamid-to-foum-zguid/"}],"approximate":"Main points; desert pistes are drawn as straight lines.","km":550,"bbox":[-6.8749,29.8167,-3.9726,31.2941],"stops":[{"name":"Merzouga","place":"Merzouga, Morocco","at":[31.0999,-4.0141],"text":"Sunset on the Erg Chebbi dunes.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Merzouga_Dunes_2011.jpg/500px-Merzouga_Dunes_2011.jpg","page":"Erg Chebbi","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Merzouga_Dunes_2011.jpg","credit":"Bjørn Christian Tørrissen","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Taouz","place":"Taouz, Morocco","at":[30.9071,-3.9967],"text":"South to the last village before the border pistes."},{"name":"Zagora","place":"Zagora, Morocco","at":[30.3033,-5.7811],"text":"Along the Draa valley's palm groves.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Zagora_56-2_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Zagora_56-2_%28cropped%29.jpg","page":"Zagora, Morocco","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zagora_56-2_%28cropped%29.jpg","credit":"Stegop","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"M'Hamid","place":"M'Hamid El Ghizlane","at":[29.8273,-5.7239],"text":"The end of the road: sand from here.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/M%27hamid-CafeUndShop.jpg/500px-M%27hamid-CafeUndShop.jpg","page":"M'Hamid El Ghizlane","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:M%27hamid-CafeUndShop.jpg","credit":"ArishG","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Erg Chigaga","place":"Erg Chigaga","at":[29.8167,-6],"text":"Wild, quieter dunes and desert camps.","source":{"label":"Horizons Unlimited","url":"https://horizonsunlimited.com/hubb/morocco/piste-mhamid-to-form-ziguid-84644"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Caravan_in_the_desert.jpg/500px-Caravan_in_the_desert.jpg","page":"Erg Chigaga","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caravan_in_the_desert.jpg","credit":"Sergey Pesterev","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Lac Iriki","place":"Lac Iriki","at":[29.8833,-6.4667],"text":"A dry lake bed as flat as a runway.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/L%E2%80%99Oasis_sacr%C3%A9e_d%E2%80%99oum_L%C3%A2alag_%28signpost%29.JPG/500px-L%E2%80%99Oasis_sacr%C3%A9e_d%E2%80%99oum_L%C3%A2alag_%28signpost%29.JPG","page":"Iriqui National Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:L%E2%80%99Oasis_sacr%C3%A9e_d%E2%80%99oum_L%C3%A2alag_%28signpost%29.JPG","credit":"NearEMPTiness","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Foum Zguid","place":"Foum Zguid, Morocco","at":[30.0859,-6.8749],"text":"Tarmac again, and a cold drink.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Foum_Zguid%2C_Platz.jpg/500px-Foum_Zguid%2C_Platz.jpg","page":"Foum Zguid","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Foum_Zguid%2C_Platz.jpg","credit":"ArnoldBetten","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":24,"line":[[31.0999,-4.0143],[30.9974,-3.9965],[30.9706,-3.9726],[30.9266,-3.9769],[30.9071,-3.9967]]},{"by":"ride","km":320,"line":[[30.9071,-3.9967],[30.9266,-3.9769],[30.9706,-3.9726],[30.9974,-3.9965]